+</style></head><body><header><h1>Creature Auto Arena Wiki</h1><nav><a href="/">← Back to game</a><a href="#rules">Rules</a><a href="#odds">Shop odds</a><a href="#synergies">Synergies</a><a href="#abilities">Abilities</a><a href="#items">Items</a><a href="#units">Units</a></nav><input id="q" placeholder="Search units, synergies, items…"></header><main><section id="rules"><h2>Rules</h2><div class="card"><ul><li><b>Board &amp; bench.</b> Your level equals the number of units you may field (Level 2 = 2 units … Level 9 = 9). The bench holds 8 units. You can only place units on the bottom 3 rows of the board.</li><li><b>Merging.</b> Three copies of the same unit at the same star level merge into one unit of the next star (max 3 stars). Items on the merged copies are kept (up to 3 per unit; extras return to your item stash). 2-star units have 2x HP and 1.8x attack; 3-star units have 4x HP and 3.2x attack.</li><li><b>Buying &amp; selling.</b> Rerolling the shop costs 1 gold. Buying XP costs 4 gold for 4 XP. Selling gives back the cost for a 1-star unit, (cost x 3 - 1) for a 2-star and (cost x 9 - 1) for a 3-star, and returns equipped items.</li><li><b>Income each round.</b> Base 4 gold (stages 1-3) or 5 gold (stage 4+), +1 for winning, +1 interest per 10 gold you hold (max +5), and a streak bonus for consecutive wins or losses: 2-3 streak +1, 4-5 streak +2, 6+ streak +3. You also gain 2 XP every round.</li><li><b>Rounds.</b> Stages 1, 2 and 3 are wild encounters (very weak). Stage 9, 14, 19, 24, 28, 32, 36 and 40 are boss fights. Every other stage is player-vs-player (or vs a bot team). Winning a wild round drops items (1 item, 2 on boss stages).</li><li><b>Taking damage.</b> Losing a PvP round costs you 2 + floor(stage x 0.6) + the number of surviving enemy units, in HP. Losing a wild round costs 1 + floor(stage / 2) + surviving enemies. You start with 100 HP; at 0 you are eliminated.</li><li><b>Combat basics.</b> Units move toward the nearest enemy and attack automatically. Base attack speed is 0.8 attacks per second. Each attack gives +10 mana (plus any bonuses) and being hit gives +4 mana; when mana is full the unit casts its ability instead of attacking. Melee units have 90 mana, ranged units 70. Damage = attack x 30 / (30 + target defense). Everyone has a 5% base crit chance (crits deal 1.5x damage). A fight lasts at most 45 seconds; if both sides survive, the side with more total remaining HP wins.</li><li><b>Synergies.</b> Count the number of DIFFERENT species you have on the board that share a type (two copies of the same unit count once). Reaching a threshold activates that tier of the bonus for every unit of that type on your team. Units have two types, so they count towards two synergies.</li><li><b>Ranked (online).</b> Standard Elo, K=32, starting at 1000. Only ranked games with 2+ human players change ratings; each human is scored against every other human by finishing order. Quitting counts as an elimination.</li></ul></div></section><section id="odds"><h2>Shop odds &amp; levels</h2><div class="tbl"><table><tr><th>Level</th><th>1-cost</th><th>2-cost</th><th>3-cost</th><th>4-cost</th><th>5-cost</th><th>XP to next</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>100%</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>2</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>100%</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>70%</td><td>30%</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>10</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>50%</td><td>40%</td><td>10%</td><td>–</td><td>–</td><td>22</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>36%</td><td>42%</td><td>20%</td><td>2%</td><td>–</td><td>34</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>25%</td><td>40%</td><td>30%</td><td>5%</td><td>–</td><td>52</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>15%</td><td>35%</td><td>35%</td><td>15%</td><td>–</td><td>72</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>11%</td><td>27%</td><td>35%</td><td>22%</td><td>5%</td><td>72</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>5%</td><td>20%</td><td>35%</td><td>30%</td><td>10%</td><td>max</td></tr></table></div></section><section id="s